sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Pipeline as Scheduler/Pipeline
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant Ntfy as ntfy.sh
  participant Phone as iPhone
  participant API as Express API
  participant Browser as Playwright
  participant X as x.com

  Pipeline->>DB: Store PENDING_APPROVAL reply
  Pipeline->>Ntfy: Publish notification with signed action URLs
  Ntfy-->>Phone: Push notification
  Phone->>API: GET /api/actions/approve/:id?token=...
  API->>API: Verify scoped HMAC action token
  API->>DB: Mark POSTING and log APPROVE
  API-->>Phone: HTML confirmation page
  API->>Browser: Open tweet and submit reply
  Browser->>X: Post reply
  Browser-->>API: Success or error
  API->>DB: Mark POSTED or ERROR
